# Small hand-written trace for experimenting with cache configurations
# Format: <address> [R|W]   (addresses may be decimal or 0x hex)
#
# Repeated addresses demonstrate hits; the 2 KiB jumps cause conflict misses
# in small direct-mapped caches.

0x10000000 R
0x10000004 R
0x10000008 R
0x1000000c R
0x10000010 R
0x10000000 R
0x10000004 R
0x10000008 R
0x1000000c W
0x10000010 R
0x10000800 R
0x10001000 R
0x10001800 R
0x10000000 R
0x10000800 R
0x10001000 R
0x10001800 R
0x10000004 W
0x10000004 R
0x10000008 R
